[?2004l[?2004h>                 "supporting_quote": "No pharmacokinetic or safety data are available regarding the use of nirmatrelvir or ritonavir in subjects with severe (Child-Pugh Class C) hepatic impairment; therefore, PAXLOVID is not recommended for use in patients with severe hepatic impairment ."
[?2004l[?2004h>             }
