[?2004lreceiv[?2004h>         "qid": "6f12607a1ba14dd5",
[?2004ls[?2004h>         "status": "ANSWERED",
[?2004l[?2004h>         "answer": "Medications that should be avoided (or are contraindicated) with Paxlovid include: alpha 1-adrenoreceptor antagonists (alfuzosin); antianginals (ranolazine); antiarrhythmics (amiodarone, dronedarone, flecainide, propafenone, quinidine); anti-gout agents (colchicine in patients with renal and/or hepatic impairment); antipsychotics (lurasidone, pimozide); benign prostatic hyperplasia agents (silodosin, tamsulosin); cardiovascular agents (eplerenone, ivabradine, aliskiren, ticagrelor, vorapaxar, clopidogrel); ergot derivatives (dihydroergotamine, ergotamine, methylergonovine); HMG-CoA reductase inhibitors (lovastatin, simvastatin); immunosuppressants (voclosporin, everolimus, sirolimus, cyclosporine/tacrolimus when monitoring is not feasible); microsomal triglyceride transfer protein inhibitors (lomitapide); migraine medications (eletriptan, ubrogepant, rimegepant); mineralocorticoid receptor antagonists (finerenone); opioid antagonists (naloxegol); PDE5 inhibitors (sildenafil for PAH, tadalafil for pulmonary hypertension); sedative/hypnotics (triazolam, oral midazolam, suvorexant); serotonin receptor 1A agonist/serotonin receptor 2A antagonists (flibanserin); vasopressin receptor antagonists (tolvaptan); and strong CYP3A inducers (apalutamide, enzalutamide, carbamazepine, phenobarbital, primidone, phenytoin, rifampin, rifapentine, lumacaftor/ivacaftor, St. John's Wort). Concomitant use of anticancer drugs (encorafenib, ivosidenib, neratinib, venetoclax, ibrutinib), anticoagulants (rivaroxaban, dabigatran), antifungals (voriconazole), antivirals (glecaprevir/pibrentasvir), and bronchodilators (salmeterol) should also be avoided.",
